#question(title: [Hockey], centered: true)[
  Which of the following statements are
  equivalent to the statement #h(1em)
  #emph[“Every Canadian man likes hockey”]?

  + If a man is Canadian, then he likes
    hockey.
  + If a man likes hockey, then he is
    Canadian.
  + If a man does not like hockey, then he is
    not Canadian.
  + If a man is not Canadian, then he likes
    hockey.
  + Non-Canadian men do not like hockey.
  + If a Canadian does not like hockey, then
    she is not a man.
]
